<title>USA: MOTOR RACING-PROVISIONAL QUALIFIERS FOR CLEVELAND CART RACE.</title>
<headline>MOTOR RACING-PROVISIONAL QUALIFIERS FOR CLEVELAND CART RACE.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVLAND, Ohio 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Top ten provisional qualifiers for Sunday's Cleveland GP CART Race after qualifying on Friday (tabulate by driver, country, chassis,</p>
<p>motor, lap time)</p>
<p>1. Alessandro Zanardi (Italy) Reynard Honda, 57.423 (132.031</p>
<p>mph/212.477kph)</p>
<p>2. Bryan Herta (U.S.) Reynard Ford, 58.151</p>
<p>3. Michael Andretti (U.S.) Swift Ford, 58.212</p>
<p>4. Gil de Ferran (Brazil) Reynard Honda, 58.280</p>
<p>5. Andre Ribeiro (Brazil) Reynard Honda, 58.367</p>
<p>6. Mauricio Gugelmin (Brazil) Reynard Mercedes-Benz, 58.407</p>
<p>7. Paul Tracy (Canada) Penske Mercedes-Benz,58.488</p>
<p>8. Greg Moore (Canada) Reynard Mercedes-Benz, 58.551</p>
<p>9. Scott Pruett (U.S.) Reynard Ford, 58.712</p>
<p>10. Christian Fittipaldi (Brazil) Swift, 58.777</p>
